+ * __PHP_Incomplete_Class, which stores the class name of every object and the
+ * payload of C: entries under these property names. Data that already carries
+ * one of them cannot be told apart from that bookkeeping, so the decode has
+ * to fail rather than let the two meanings be confused. */
